# 🚀 Run Commands

This document contains all the commands required to set up and run the **AI-Powered Log Analyzer & Root Cause Analysis (RCA) Tool**.

---

# 📥 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/AkshunMehrotra/log-Analyzer-and-RCA-using-AI.git
```

---

# 📂 2. Move into the Project Directory

```bash
cd log-Analyzer-and-RCA-using-AI
```

---

# 📂 3. Move into Backend Directory

```bash
cd backend
```

---

# 🐍 4. Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

---

# ▶️ 5. Activate Virtual Environment

## Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

## Linux / macOS

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

---

# 📦 6. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# 🔑 7. Create Environment File

Create a `.env` file inside the **backend** directory.

```env
GROQ_API_KEY=YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY
```

---

# 🚀 8. Run the FastAPI Server by going inside the backend by using 

cd backend 

```bash
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

---

# 🌐 9. Access the Application

## Backend API

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

## Swagger UI

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

## ReDoc Documentation

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000/redoc
```

---

# 🛑 10. Stop the Server

Press

```text
CTRL + C
```

---

# 🔄 11. Deactivate Virtual Environment

```bash
deactivate
```

---

# 📦 Installing New Packages

```bash
pip install package_name
```

Example

```bash
pip install pandas
```

---

# 📝 Update Requirements File

Whenever a new package is installed, update the requirements file.

```bash
pip freeze > requirements.txt
```

